  "text": "Institutes \nUpcoming Institutes\nInstitute Insights\nRecent Institutes\nInstitute Gallery\nWhat is an Institute?\nThink Tanks & Roundtables \nUpcoming Think Tanks & Roundtables\nRecent Think Tanks & Roundtables\nWhat is a Think Tank?\nAbout IPMI \nAbout IPMI\nTestimonials\nFAQ\nAttend an Institute\nSpeak at an Institute\nPartner with IPMI\nContact Us\nATTEND AN INSTITUTE\nABOUT IPMI\nInternational Performance\nManagement Institute.\nGet to know our team, our vision, and our mission.\nLEARN ABOUT IPMI\nOUR MISSION\n\nRevitalizing the way Interactions and Knowledge Transfer take place.\n\nIPMI was formed with the vision of revitalizing the way interactions and knowledge transfer take place.  In the cyber age where information is only an isolated click away, we saw an opportunity to enhance the partnership experience by fostering intimate environments of information exchange: face-to-face, meaningful, and impactful. Our experience spans over a decade of successfully delivering high-quality business-to-business events and services across a variety of industries; our commitment to growing your network and improving your business is at the heart of what we do.\n\nIPMI has refreshed  the way knowledge transfer takes place by engaging with like-minded CxOs from different industry verticals to discuss current trends, benchmark performance and share best practices in an intimate environment.\n\nWe invite you to browse the website to get to know us a little better and reach out on the Contact Us page to find out which Institute is the right fit for your interests and priorities. We look forward to hosting you!\n\nINSTITUTE STATS\n20\nInstitutes\n2,000\n+\nCXOs\n300\n+\nSpeakers\n200\n+\nPartners\nLEARN MORE\nWant to Learn More about IPMI?\nReach out to us!\nATTEND AN INSTITUTE\nCONTACT US\nInfo@IPMIOnline.com\n(416) 628-4058\n151 Bloor Street W.\nToronto, ON\nCanada M5S1S4\nINSTITUTES\nUpcoming Institutes\nInstitute Insights\nRecent Institutes\nInstitute Gallery\nWhat is an Institute?\nTHINK TANKS &\nROUNDTABLES\nUpcoming Think Tanks\nRecent Think Tanks\nWhat is a Think Tank?\nABOUT IPMI\nAbout IPMI\nTestimonials\nFAQ\nAttend an Institute\nSpeak at an Institute\nPartner with IPMI\nCONTACT US\nContact Us\nCONNECT\n© International Performance Management Institute. All Rights Reserved.\nPrivacy Policy | Terms and Conditions\nHeading\nHeading\nHeading\nHeading",
